{"slug":"greetings-starter-l13","artistFeel":"Shakira","beat":"Romantic Slow","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 13","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":13,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"Latin","lyrics":"¡Hey! ¡Vamos ya!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's dance… Bailemos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nFeel the rhythm with me.\n\n[Verse]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nThe sun is shining bright.\nGreeting everyone… Saludo a todos\nHere at the concert tonight.\nFriend… Amigo\nWe're singing side by side.\nSay hello… Saluda\nTo the music, feel alive.\nSpeak… Habla\nLet the music take control.\nListen… Escucha\nTo the beat that moves your soul.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's dance… Bailemos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nFeel the rhythm with me.\n\n[Verse]\nRespond… Responde\nTo the call of the night.\nAsk… Pregunta\nWhat's the next song they might play.\nIntroduce… Presenta\nYourself to someone new.\nGood day… Buen día\nThis moment's just for you.\nDe nada… You're welcome\nFor the smile you bring.\nHola… Hello\nIn this vibrant Latin swing.\n\n[Bridge]\nThe crowd's alive, the energy's high,\nEvery greeting, every wave goodbye.\nIn this place, we all unite,","vocab":[{"es":"buenos días/tardes","en":"good morning/afternoon"},{"es":"saludo","en":"greeting"},{"es":"amigo","en":"friend"},{"es":"saluda","en":"greet"},{"es":"habla","en":"speak"},{"es":"escucha","en":"listen"},{"es":"responde","en":"respond"},{"es":"pregunta","en":"ask"},{"es":"presenta","en":"introduce"},{"es":"buen día","en":"good day"},{"es":"amable","en":"kind"},{"es":"nombre","en":"name"},{"es":"encantado","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"disculpa","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"cuídate","en":"take care"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.56,"end":12.959,"loss":4.985914248511905},{"start":12.96,"end":15.56,"loss":6.6997725168863935},{"start":15.56,"end":18.33,"loss":2.731271489461263},{"start":18.